<title>UK: DHL to up UK staff 500 to 3,500 by end-97.</title>
<headline>DHL to up UK staff 500 to 3,500 by end-97.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>DHL Worldwide Express will increase its UK staff to about 3,500 from the present 3,000 by the end of this year, said its UK managing director Nick Butcher.</p>
<p>He said the fast-growing express parcels giant's UK revenue had increased to 70 million stg in January-March this year from 55 million stg in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Butcher did not say where the new employees would be based. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017</p>
